{"2259390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NINE ROUNDS RAPID", "steam_appid": 2259390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY YOUR WAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for freedom in this top-down, fast-paced, action-roguelike. On a possessed, fragmenting space station, survival is not a given, and how you escape is up to you. Mow down enemies solo, team up online, or hop on the couch and fight side by side. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/09920fed9126dd81d8e6a63543f6eed7.poster.avif?t=1787815029\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/09920fed9126dd81d8e6a63543f6eed7.webm?t=1787815029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/09920fed9126dd81d8e6a63543f6eed7.mp4?t=1787815029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whichever way you play, co-op or single-player, no two runs will be the same. With hand-drawn, procedurally generated maps, giving millions of permutations per run, you’ll have plenty of reasons to hop back in for “just one more run”. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/7ff11e26b985a92abf401df2cbbb5adb.poster.avif?t=1787815029\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/7ff11e26b985a92abf401df2cbbb5adb.webm?t=1787815029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/7ff11e26b985a92abf401df2cbbb5adb.mp4?t=1787815029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANIPULATE TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause, slow, or rewind time to dodge projectile storms, outrun rapid foes, and beat the station's decay. Running low on time? Steal some from your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NINE BOSSES, NINE LEVELS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level ends in a terrifying gatekeeper, with tactics built to end your run. Stopping you is all they want, so bring everything in your arsenal. Each one demands a unique approach, so look sharp and keep your wits about you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/241bcfa90910ba0bbcad3f0b096659f8.poster.avif?t=1787815029\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/241bcfa90910ba0bbcad3f0b096659f8.webm?t=1787815029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/241bcfa90910ba0bbcad3f0b096659f8.mp4?t=1787815029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADES, UPGRADES, UPGRADES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find everything from simple blasters to chaos-evoking dimension weapons. Score mods from chests and a rather snarky shopkeeper; trust us, his wares are worth the attitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then upgrade a slew of special abilities, stealth or health, mines or orbital drops. Swap builds on the fly, and carry perks between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/df1a52366d89d67d13476e1b8aba33e5.poster.avif?t=1787815029\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/df1a52366d89d67d13476e1b8aba33e5.webm?t=1787815029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/df1a52366d89d67d13476e1b8aba33e5.mp4?t=1787815029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY YOUR WAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for freedom in this top-down, fast-paced, action-roguelike. On a possessed, fragmenting space station, survival is not a given, and how you escape is up to you. Mow down enemies solo, team up online, or hop on the couch and fight side by side. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/09920fed9126dd81d8e6a63543f6eed7.poster.avif?t=1787815029\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/09920fed9126dd81d8e6a63543f6eed7.webm?t=1787815029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/09920fed9126dd81d8e6a63543f6eed7.mp4?t=1787815029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whichever way you play, co-op or single-player, no two runs will be the same. With hand-drawn, procedurally generated maps, giving millions of permutations per run, you’ll have plenty of reasons to hop back in for “just one more run”. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/7ff11e26b985a92abf401df2cbbb5adb.poster.avif?t=1787815029\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/7ff11e26b985a92abf401df2cbbb5adb.webm?t=1787815029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/7ff11e26b985a92abf401df2cbbb5adb.mp4?t=1787815029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANIPULATE TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause, slow, or rewind time to dodge projectile storms, outrun rapid foes, and beat the station's decay. Running low on time? Steal some from your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NINE BOSSES, NINE LEVELS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level ends in a terrifying gatekeeper, with tactics built to end your run. Stopping you is all they want, so bring everything in your arsenal. Each one demands a unique approach, so look sharp and keep your wits about you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/241bcfa90910ba0bbcad3f0b096659f8.poster.avif?t=1787815029\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/241bcfa90910ba0bbcad3f0b096659f8.webm?t=1787815029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/241bcfa90910ba0bbcad3f0b096659f8.mp4?t=1787815029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADES, UPGRADES, UPGRADES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find everything from simple blasters to chaos-evoking dimension weapons. Score mods from chests and a rather snarky shopkeeper; trust us, his wares are worth the attitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then upgrade a slew of special abilities, stealth or health, mines or orbital drops. Swap builds on the fly, and carry perks between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/df1a52366d89d67d13476e1b8aba33e5.poster.avif?t=1787815029\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/df1a52366d89d67d13476e1b8aba33e5.webm?t=1787815029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/df1a52366d89d67d13476e1b8aba33e5.mp4?t=1787815029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Blast your way to freedom, solo or with a friend in online or local co-op, through a possessed, fragmenting space station. Upgrade abilities, mod your weapon builds, and manipulate time to defeat the station's nine gatekeepers. Power up, progress, and learn the ugly truth with every escape attempt.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/1d3988200dfbcee4b0fe0ec0f65ae6a0aedfff6b/header.jpg?t=1787815029", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/d9c3f8cff55c397d9a1357370f7cb4f91f33c741/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787815029", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/d9c3f8cff55c397d9a1357370f7cb4f91f33c741/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787815029", "website": "http://www.nineroundsrapid.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8.1/10